{{Quote|Hi, Mom! Hi, Mama!|Nash Durango|<ref name="Nash's Race Day" />}}
'''Kryys Durango''' was one of the two mothers of the [[pilot]] [[Nash Durango]]. She lived during the [[High Republic Era]] on [[Tenoo]] together with her partner, [[Ceeli Durango]]. They both watched their daughter race in and win the [[Kublop Classic]].<ref name="Nash's Race Day" />

